Laila Ka Laal Khoon Me Sab Laal Hogaya<br>
<br>
Jo Hu-Ba_Hu Sahbi-e-Nabi Tha Khuda Gawa<br>
Barchi Ushi Ke Sine Pa Zalim Ne Mariah<br>
Iss Zulm Se Bichard Ke Quhan Phat Nahi Pada<br>
<br>
Akber Ki Aankhen Band Thi Sine Pa Haath The<br>
Sarwar Ne Zor Deke Jo Bete Ke Sine Se<br>
Khainchi Sina Tho Khoon Ka Darya Ubal Pada<br>
<br>
Kaise Nikali Apne Ya Shah-e-Insojaa<br>
Kadyal Jawan Ke Sine Se Tooti Huwi Sina<br>
Hairath Zada Hai Aaj Talak Sare Ambiya<br>
<br>
Aayi Hai Hichki Aaqri Uss Noor-e-Ain Ko<br>
Allaha Aake Kaun Sambhale Hussian Ko<br>
Beta Jawan Margaya Athara Saal Ka<br>
<br>
Lasha Jawan Bete Ka Qaime Me Aaya Hai<br>
Arma Har Ek Bibi Ka Khoon Me Nahaya Hai<br>
Fizza Ne Sar Ko Pit-Liya Aur Ye Di Sada<br>
<br>
Sadma Jawan Bete Ka KaiSe Sahegi Maa<br>
Jab Tak Zindagi Hai Tadapti Rahegi Maa<br>
Lasha Rahega Aankhoun Me Kadyal Jawan Ka<br>
<br>
Sine Pe Gehra Zaqm Badan Sab Lahoo Me Tar<br>
Iss Haal Me Shabi-e-Payambar Ko Dekh kar<br>
Zainab Ne Kaise Sabr Kiya Hoga Ya Khuda<br>
<br>
Ahsan Dua Ye Karte Hai Ya Shah-e-Mashraqain<br>
Humko Naseeb Teri Ziyarat Ho Ya Hussian<br>
Nouha Ye Hum Padhenge Jo Pahunchenge Karbala